WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.980
Asahi!

00:02.980 --> 00:04.840
Where are you going?

00:04.840 --> 00:06.800
Aren't you gonna pour me a drink?

00:06.800 --> 00:08.150
Ugh, you reek of booze.

00:08.150 --> 00:10.940
And I told you already. 
I'm going on a quest today.

00:10.940 --> 00:13.530
Asahi, you're such a diligent worker.

00:13.530 --> 00:16.480
Just for today, you should drink 
through the night with me.

00:17.870 --> 00:19.840
Stop pestering him, Kilmaria.

00:19.840 --> 00:24.080
Honestly, drinking so early in the morning... 
You're the definition of a useless human being.

00:24.080 --> 00:27.630
But I'm not a human! I'm a demon!

00:27.630 --> 00:29.090
That's a little kid's comeback!

00:30.400 --> 00:33.450
Well, anyway, we're leaving 
the house in your care, Kilmaria.

00:33.450 --> 00:36.950
Don't make too much of a mess and limit 
your alcohol intake to one bottle a day.

00:36.950 --> 00:38.560
What's this? What's this?

00:38.560 --> 00:42.730
Leaving the tedious stuff to me 
so the two of you can go off and have fun?

00:42.730 --> 00:46.360
You could treat me a little 
more like a guest in your...

00:48.120 --> 00:51.040
Leaving a drunk there on 
her own does make me anxious.

00:51.040 --> 00:52.650
Let's wrap it up quick so we can go home.

00:52.650 --> 00:55.910
R-Right. Um, about today's quest...

00:57.710 --> 01:01.790
We're going to be searching for golden 
flowers in the depths of Twelxday Plain!

01:01.790 --> 01:04.070
Exalted Hero!

01:05.120 --> 01:09.210
<i>Th-That carefree voice that sounds like 
it will innocently bring trouble with it...</i>

01:09.210 --> 01:13.480
Tanya-san told me you'd
 left on a gathering quest!

01:15.350 --> 01:17.860
Please allow me to accompany you.

01:19.480 --> 01:21.710
Good morning, Oneesama.

01:21.710 --> 01:23.180
Morning.

01:24.030 --> 01:27.260
<i>And here I was, thinking I'd get 
to go on a nice, quiet quest today.</i>

01:28.220 --> 01:32.510
If it's an item that's difficult to obtain, 
the more people the better, don't you think?

01:33.360 --> 01:34.400
That's true.

01:34.400 --> 01:36.250
It's just as you say, Oneesama.

01:36.250 --> 01:39.780
And I happen to excel at finding items!

01:39.780 --> 01:41.280
Y-You do?

01:41.610 --> 01:44.580
Yes! Please watch my ability in action.

01:45.820 --> 01:52.250
O gods, reveal the path the Hero 
must take. This is a prayer for salvation.

01:55.270 --> 01:56.630
Guidance, show thyself!

02:07.050 --> 02:07.980
Seems it's this way!

02:08.230 --> 02:09.900
You're just guessing!

