03:40.990 --> 03:43.880
<b>Episode 9</b>

03:40.990 --> 03:43.880
<b>The Preferred 
\h\hForm of a</b>

03:40.990 --> 03:43.880
<b>Big</b>

03:40.990 --> 03:43.910
<b>Sister</b>

03:44.130 --> 03:47.640
<b>Twelxday Plain</b>

03:54.440 --> 03:56.470
Hmm. A fork in the road, huh?

03:56.470 --> 03:58.160
Which way do we go?

03:58.160 --> 03:59.950
Time for some more divination?

03:59.950 --> 04:01.800
No chance! Give it a rest!

04:02.080 --> 04:04.580
The quest has to be completed today, right?

04:04.580 --> 04:07.100
We likely don't have time 
to do a leisurely search.

04:07.450 --> 04:09.450
Shall we split up into two groups?

04:09.450 --> 04:11.680
I will act as support for the Exalted Hero.

04:11.680 --> 04:13.060
T-Two groups?

04:14.560 --> 04:16.380
I-I'll go on my own!

04:16.380 --> 04:18.490
Maya-nee, you can go with Sophie.

04:18.490 --> 04:19.570
Really?

04:19.570 --> 04:22.920
If I go with Sophie, I'll get caught up
 in some kind of trouble for sure.

04:22.090 --> 04:27.570
<b>A Girl 
Unaware She's
 a Troublemaker</b>

04:23.820 --> 04:27.570
But I don't know if I feel safe leaving you alone...

04:29.090 --> 04:30.380
Maya-nee?

04:30.380 --> 04:32.810
No. It seems everything's fine.

04:32.810 --> 04:35.080
All right. I'll go with Sophie.

04:35.080 --> 04:36.830
Oh, but...

04:37.170 --> 04:40.500
I'll use this opportunity to tell you 
all <i>sorts</i> of stories about Asahi!

04:40.500 --> 04:44.440
Like how, when Asahi was five, 
we took our first family trip to the ocean!

04:44.440 --> 04:45.100
Tell me more!

04:45.100 --> 04:47.010
Don't give her any weird ideas!

04:48.530 --> 04:50.850
Guess I get to have a 
relaxing time on my own today.

04:52.130 --> 04:54.720
Aha! A human!

04:55.600 --> 04:56.730
A goblin!

04:56.730 --> 04:58.970
If there's just one, this'll be easy.

04:59.570 --> 05:01.530
Gotcha!

05:02.810 --> 05:04.740
<i>Th-This is bad!</i>

05:11.610 --> 05:14.200
What was that? Another monster?

05:24.620 --> 05:26.470
What was all that about?

05:29.230 --> 05:30.390
You all good, Asahi?

05:30.970 --> 05:32.390
Kilmaria?

05:32.640 --> 05:35.110
Did you just save me with your magic?

05:35.110 --> 05:37.310
Wait, why are you even here at all?

05:37.710 --> 05:40.310
What do you mean? 
I was just walking off the alcohol.

05:40.310 --> 05:42.860
And you ended up all the way out here?

05:42.860 --> 05:44.030
That's right.

05:44.550 --> 05:46.570
I wandered pretty far without realizing it.

05:48.590 --> 05:50.330
Thank you, Kilmaria.

05:51.670 --> 05:53.870
I told you, I'm just taking a walk.

05:54.450 --> 05:55.540
Hey, wait.

05:56.240 --> 06:00.960
Does that mean Maya-nee let me go off by 
myself 'cause she knew Kilmaria was nearby?

06:01.210 --> 06:04.630
Hmph. That woman seriously isn't human.

06:05.300 --> 06:10.800
I suppressed my presence and followed 
several kilometers behind, you know.

06:10.800 --> 06:15.900
Hang on. If my sister has such extreme 
hypersensitivity and I live with her, then...

06:19.460 --> 06:21.390
Maya-nee, that tickles!

06:19.770 --> 06:20.620
<b>tickles</b>

06:21.110 --> 06:22.210
<b>tickles</b>

06:22.440 --> 06:23.190
What?

06:25.170 --> 06:26.900
So you wanna be tickled, huh?

06:26.900 --> 06:28.990
A-sa-hi!

06:28.990 --> 06:31.140
That's freakin' terrifying!

06:31.850 --> 06:33.990
That sounds like something 
she'd be able to do.

06:34.360 --> 06:40.480
Now that I think about it, the first time 
we met, I saved you in a forest like this one.

06:40.480 --> 06:42.340
That time, I was attacked by a bear.

06:42.340 --> 06:46.460
When you ran toward me, 
you mistook me for your older sister.

06:46.710 --> 06:50.880
Y-You're the one who got the 
wrong idea and attacked me.

06:51.470 --> 06:55.290
Until now, fighting was 
the only thing I lived for.

06:57.480 --> 07:01.650
But after meeting you two siblings, 
I've changed quite a bit.

07:02.260 --> 07:05.610
As one of the top-ranked officers in 
the Demon King's army, is that all right?

07:06.970 --> 07:09.280
I just live as I like.

07:13.800 --> 07:15.770
A m-monster!

07:15.770 --> 07:17.120
Someone save us!

07:17.120 --> 07:18.390
This way!

07:18.390 --> 07:19.750
Wait, Asahi!

07:34.570 --> 07:36.560
I've come to help. Can you hear me?

07:38.470 --> 07:40.530
Wh-What is all this?

07:45.340 --> 07:47.570
They're so beautiful...

07:47.900 --> 07:49.940
These human souls.

07:51.590 --> 07:57.220
Your souls shall continue 
to shine their light upon me!

07:57.830 --> 08:00.830
So this is your handiwork?
 You attacked these villagers?

08:00.830 --> 08:04.580
Hm? An adventurer all the way out here?

08:04.580 --> 08:07.590
You guys can deal with him.

08:10.380 --> 08:11.380
Skeletons?

08:12.340 --> 08:14.640
This guy's a necromancer.

