08:24.950 --> 08:26.860
You have some skill.

08:28.400 --> 08:33.030
I shall add your soul to my collection.

08:45.120 --> 08:48.130
Y-You... It can't be!

08:48.460 --> 08:52.440
One of the Demon King's Six Generals...
 Kilmaria of Corruption?!

08:52.440 --> 08:55.220
And if I am? What the hell
do you think you're doing?

08:55.510 --> 08:57.450
Please wait!

08:57.450 --> 09:00.550
I serve one of the Demon King's
 Six Generals, Woodvoss-sama!

09:00.550 --> 09:02.980
I am the wizard known as Malvekanth!

09:03.390 --> 09:05.770
<i>He's part of the Demon 
King's army, like Kilmaria.</i>

09:06.640 --> 09:08.580
This <i>is</i> fortuitous!

09:08.580 --> 09:13.110
When I attacked this village out of boredom, 
I never imagined <i>you</i> would show up!

09:13.110 --> 09:15.740
Just what do you think humans are?

09:16.070 --> 09:20.440
Of course, someone who steals the 
souls of creatures no better than bugs

09:20.440 --> 09:24.580
could never measure up to someone 
who has no qualms incinerating allies.

09:25.550 --> 09:29.960
But with you here, we could march
 on the royal capital and take it.

09:30.420 --> 09:34.010
Now, let us go forth and 
crush the humans underfoot!

09:34.330 --> 09:35.800
Quit kidding around!

09:35.800 --> 09:38.050
Kilmaria isn't the kind 
of person who'd do that!

09:39.080 --> 09:43.250
True, she loafs around when drinking,
 and she's totally hopeless sometimes,

09:43.250 --> 09:46.980
but she's honest and kind, 
and she's saved me lots of times.

09:47.380 --> 09:49.610
She's an incredibly good person!

09:50.540 --> 09:51.820
A-Asahi...

09:52.900 --> 09:54.570
What idiocy is this?

09:55.170 --> 10:00.730
Now, Kilmaria-sama, dispose of this 
ignorant chump and let's get going.

10:00.730 --> 10:03.920
Ignorant chumps should
 watch their tongues.

10:03.920 --> 10:04.370
What?

10:05.020 --> 10:08.870
I'm telling you not to speak 
so arrogantly, you fool.

10:09.450 --> 10:11.130
Flame Lance!

10:26.220 --> 10:28.690
In time, the villagers should wake up, too.

10:28.920 --> 10:32.150
You sure about this? He was 
your ally, right? Given your position.

10:32.720 --> 10:36.860
I couldn't care less about some masked chump 
with such a distasteful hobby. Besides...

10:37.370 --> 10:38.400
"Besides"?

10:38.400 --> 10:40.160
<b>Scratch\h\hScratch</b>

10:42.260 --> 10:44.410
When someone badmouths my little bro,

10:45.060 --> 10:47.790
as your big sis, I have to 
make sure I look good, right?

10:51.910 --> 10:54.950
Guess we should go meet up 
with Maya-nee and Sophie.

10:54.950 --> 10:56.570
Yeah, we should.

10:58.740 --> 11:00.490
Exalted Hero!

11:00.490 --> 11:02.300
Maya-nee! Sophie!

11:03.380 --> 11:04.810
Who is this?

11:04.810 --> 11:07.720
Oh, um, she's an acquaintance
 of mine and Maya-nee's.

11:08.380 --> 11:09.920
I ran into her in the forest.

11:09.920 --> 11:12.270
Asahi, you're not hurt, are you?

11:12.270 --> 11:12.420
Hmm

11:12.270 --> 11:16.280
Of course not. A booze-loving 
lady saved me, after all.

11:12.420 --> 11:12.670
Hmm

11:12.670 --> 11:12.920
Hmm

11:12.920 --> 11:13.170
Hmm

