11:16.280 --> 11:17.400
There, there.

11:17.850 --> 11:19.820
Anyway, did you gather anything?

11:19.820 --> 11:21.410
We did! Take a look.

11:21.860 --> 11:23.780
So <i>this</i> is the nearly mythical flower!

11:24.320 --> 11:26.000
How did you find it?

11:26.730 --> 11:29.290
We just had a fun little stroll.

11:29.800 --> 11:35.360
When Asahi was little, he'd get so scared 
at night, he'd burrow into my bed.

11:36.070 --> 11:39.510
So even the Exalted Hero 
was like that as a child, huh?

11:39.510 --> 11:42.340
Oh, isn't that the flower we're looking for?

11:42.770 --> 11:44.050
Let's see...

11:43.140 --> 11:44.050
<b>Rumble
Rumble</b>

11:43.140 --> 11:44.050
<b>Rumble 
Rumble
 Rumble</b>

11:44.050 --> 11:48.890
<b>Ker-smash!</b>

11:45.570 --> 11:48.840
Aw, it seems to be a different variety.

11:48.840 --> 11:52.570
Yup, Sophie and I had a nice, peaceful time.

11:48.890 --> 11:49.220
<b>Ker-smash!</b>

11:49.220 --> 11:50.040
<b>Ker-smash!</b>

11:52.570 --> 11:54.810
No, you skipped something 
big in the middle there!

11:54.810 --> 11:57.990
Even when he was little, Asahi was adorable.

11:55.370 --> 11:59.650
Hearing about the Exalted Hero's 
childhood was so much fun!

12:00.420 --> 12:01.950
Right?

