My Big Sister</b>

12:16.590 --> 12:17.170
Mistress.

12:17.890 --> 12:19.840
Please wake up, mistress.

12:22.570 --> 12:24.640
Ten more minutes.

12:26.980 --> 12:27.820
Hup.

12:28.880 --> 12:31.380
Is that any way to wake your mistress, Kuon?

12:31.380 --> 12:34.310
Couldn't you just gently whisper 
into my ear to wake me?

12:34.310 --> 12:37.270
We must always be on guard. 
You left yourself defenseless, mistress.

12:38.250 --> 12:41.820
There is no knowing when 
we might be attacked.

12:42.450 --> 12:47.280
I cannot imagine there is anyone 
who would dare try to ambush me.

12:47.280 --> 12:48.170
Besides...

12:49.610 --> 12:52.400
Kuon, the reason I can sleep
 with my heart at ease

12:52.800 --> 12:56.630
is because you are by 
my side, protecting me.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.050
I see.

13:01.840 --> 13:05.080
Now that preparations are complete,

13:05.080 --> 13:08.480
it is time at last to implement our plan.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.100
At last?

13:10.700 --> 13:15.600
In this mission, I will handle the 
attacking alone as much as possible.

13:16.190 --> 13:17.700
Which is why, Kuon...

13:17.700 --> 13:21.070
I will provide support in 
preparation for the decisive moment.

13:21.660 --> 13:23.680
I understand, mistress.

13:23.680 --> 13:25.460
I'd expect no less of you, Kuon.

13:25.460 --> 13:28.070
And now, we go.

13:31.160 --> 13:33.040
Asahi-kun, what you did was amazing!

13:34.040 --> 13:34.870
Huh?

13:35.620 --> 13:39.060
Uh, what exactly <i>did</i> I do, Tanya?

13:39.060 --> 13:44.020
Aw, come on now. I heard you 
defeated the necromancer, Malvekanth.

13:44.020 --> 13:45.670
Mal... Oh.

13:45.670 --> 13:47.230
You're amazing!

13:47.230 --> 13:48.570
<i>That was...</i>

13:51.160 --> 13:53.770
<i>the one from the Demon King's
 army that Kilmaria defeated.</i>

13:55.420 --> 13:59.040
Now it's just a matter of time 
before they make you Golem Class!

13:59.040 --> 14:00.640
Y-Yeah, I guess so.

14:00.640 --> 14:04.280
<i>My reputation shot up like an eel out 
of wet hands while I wasn't looking.</i>

14:04.590 --> 14:08.220
When you get promoted, we'll have
 to celebrate! What should we eat?

14:08.220 --> 14:10.160
U-Um, freshwater eel?

14:10.160 --> 14:11.590
Freshwater eel?

14:11.590 --> 14:13.090
Or maybe...

14:14.850 --> 14:17.660
<i>The gap between my skill and 
my rep keeps getting bigger.</i>

14:24.500 --> 14:25.590
O-Oh my!

14:26.270 --> 14:29.020
What a coincidence, 
running into you like this, Asahi!

14:29.020 --> 14:30.520
Gloria?

14:30.520 --> 14:33.000
It looked like you were 
lying in wait just now.

14:33.340 --> 14:35.160
You're imagining things.

14:36.590 --> 14:41.540
More importantly, I'm honored 
that you r-r-remember me.

14:41.540 --> 14:44.090
Well, I mean, I couldn't <i>possibly</i> forget...

14:44.090 --> 14:45.940
<i>...such an idiosyncratic character.</i>

14:46.250 --> 14:47.860
C-C-Couldn't forget?

14:47.860 --> 14:51.870
Y-You mean you c-couldn't forget m-me?

14:54.820 --> 14:58.500
Kuon! To my side, Kuon!

14:59.190 --> 15:01.370
Wasn't that a little quick, mistress?

15:03.430 --> 15:06.380
Didn't you tell me you'd 
be all right on your own?

15:06.630 --> 15:08.370
I-I can't.

15:08.370 --> 15:11.130
I don't know what to do. Please stay here.

15:11.680 --> 15:13.300
Stay close to me, Kuon!

15:13.600 --> 15:15.020
Dear me.

15:13.700 --> 15:17.330
<b>Whisper
Whisper</b>

15:13.700 --> 15:17.330
<b>Whisper
Whisper</b>

15:15.020 --> 15:17.760
And after we ran so many 
simulations yesterday.

15:17.680 --> 15:21.310
<b>Whisper
Whisper</b>

15:17.680 --> 15:21.310
<b>Whisper
Whisper</b>

15:17.760 --> 15:21.770
But when the r-real thing is in front of me,
 my mind goes completely blank!

15:21.770 --> 15:23.810
Wh-What did you two come here to do?

15:23.810 --> 15:26.940
Well, you see, my mistress wished 
to see you again, Mister Asahi, so—

15:27.230 --> 15:29.610
Don't tell him <i>that!</i>

15:29.950 --> 15:30.660
Honestly!

15:30.660 --> 15:32.820
Oh, I see. I understand everything, Gloria.

15:33.200 --> 15:36.580
What? You mean you've noticed how I feel?

15:36.580 --> 15:39.660
You still suspect I've falsified
 my rank, don't you?

15:43.120 --> 15:45.840
Mister Asahi, a moment, 
if you please. It isn't that, it's—

15:46.130 --> 15:50.510
<b>Squeeze</b>

15:46.130 --> 15:50.510
<b>Squeeze</b>

15:46.290 --> 15:48.280
Yes! That's it exactly!

15:48.280 --> 15:50.880
So you will accompany us on our quest today!

15:50.880 --> 15:52.240
What? Right now?

15:52.240 --> 15:56.390
Indeed. This time, I will not fail 
to ascertain your true abilities!

15:58.410 --> 16:00.330
Do you know of the Bewildering Forest?

16:01.730 --> 16:06.110
Lately, there has been one report after 
another of adventurers going missing there.

16:06.400 --> 16:11.050
Kuon and I agreed to a quest to 
look into the cause of these incidents,

16:11.050 --> 16:14.670
and I thought you could assist us, Asahi.

16:14.670 --> 16:18.030
Though, of course, it's all just
 to assess your actual rank.

16:18.480 --> 16:19.870
R-Right.

16:20.250 --> 16:23.040
Mistress, what are your intentions here?

16:20.390 --> 16:25.630
Whisper
Whisper

16:23.040 --> 16:25.630
The plan was just to invite 
him to tea today, wasn't it?

16:26.080 --> 16:27.710
Don't you understand, Kuon?

16:28.810 --> 16:31.450
A stroll through the forest
that's just the two of us...

16:31.810 --> 16:33.930
That's what they call a "date"!

16:33.930 --> 16:38.220
But I am here as well, and this is a 
very dangerous place to have a date.

16:38.670 --> 16:42.210
If this is a date, then show 
Mister Asahi your cute side.

16:42.210 --> 16:43.440
H-How?

16:43.820 --> 16:45.510
This is the Bewildering Forest.

16:45.510 --> 16:48.830
Suggest holding hands to make 
sure neither of you get lost.

16:48.830 --> 16:51.150
Oh, I get it! You're a genius!

16:51.700 --> 16:52.950
Asahi.

16:52.950 --> 16:55.030
Wh-What is it, Gloria?

16:54.570 --> 16:55.780
Pant

16:54.570 --> 16:55.780
Pant

16:54.570 --> 16:55.780
Pant

16:54.570 --> 16:55.780
Pant

16:55.030 --> 16:59.120
T-T-To make sure neither of us get lost...

16:55.780 --> 16:56.320
Pant

16:55.780 --> 16:56.320
Pant

16:55.780 --> 16:56.320
Pant

16:55.780 --> 16:56.320
Pant

16:56.320 --> 16:58.660
Pant

16:56.320 --> 16:58.660
Pant

16:56.320 --> 16:58.660
Pant

16:56.320 --> 16:58.660
Pant

16:59.220 --> 17:02.540
<b>Crack
Crunch</b>

16:59.220 --> 17:02.540
<b>Crack
Crunch</b>

16:59.330 --> 17:01.450
<b>A Girl of 
Monstrous 
Strength</b>

16:59.400 --> 17:01.080
let's hold hands!

17:01.080 --> 17:03.320
Ow, ow, <i>ow!</i>

17:01.450 --> 17:02.540
<b>A Girl of 
Monstrous 
Strength</b>

17:03.740 --> 17:05.900
That didn't work. Do you have any other ideas?

17:05.900 --> 17:09.840
I see. In that case, perhaps pretend 
to be scared and cling to Mister Asahi.

17:11.780 --> 17:12.630
What is it?

17:12.630 --> 17:15.180
It's so dark and scary!

17:12.760 --> 17:12.960
<b>A Girl of
 Monstrous 
Strength</b>

17:12.960 --> 17:14.340
<b>A Girl of
 Monstrous 
Strength</b>

17:13.440 --> 17:15.180
<b>Crack</b>

17:13.440 --> 17:15.180
<b>Crunch
Crunch</b>

17:14.340 --> 17:15.180
<b>A Girl of
 Monstrous 
Strength</b>

17:15.690 --> 17:18.220
Or perhaps remove a leaf 
that has landed in his hair?

17:18.010 --> 17:18.160
<b>Whoosh</b>

17:18.090 --> 17:18.220
<b>A Girl of 
Monstrous 
Strength</b>

17:18.160 --> 17:18.660
<b>Whoosh</b>

17:18.220 --> 17:20.330
Y-You've got something in your hair!

17:18.220 --> 17:21.100
<b>A Girl of 
Monstrous 
Strength</b>

17:18.660 --> 17:19.160
<b>Whoosh</b>

17:19.160 --> 17:19.660
<b>Whoosh</b>

17:19.660 --> 17:20.160
<b>Whoosh</b>

17:20.160 --> 17:20.660
<b>Whoosh</b>

17:20.660 --> 17:21.100
<b>Whoosh</b>

17:22.200 --> 17:25.060
I-Is this punishment for falsifying my rank?

17:25.550 --> 17:27.770
Th-That didn't work, either.

17:27.210 --> 17:29.310
<b>A Girl With 
Muscles 
for Brains</b>

17:27.770 --> 17:29.310
You're too much of a musclebrain.

17:30.110 --> 17:31.570
Ow.

17:31.570 --> 17:34.230
I feel like I'm already 
running low on stamina.

17:34.230 --> 17:36.390
Our deepest apologies, Mister Asahi.

17:36.390 --> 17:39.490
But as an Ogre Class, this level of 
damage should be no issue...

17:39.490 --> 17:41.750
Huh? Yeah, I'm fine. Totally fine.

17:44.020 --> 17:46.620
But, Kuon, you have it pretty rough, don't you?

17:46.620 --> 17:49.080
Getting dragged all over 
by such an active young lady.

17:49.080 --> 17:51.540
Your situation is similar, 
isn't it, Mister Asahi?

17:51.540 --> 17:52.150
Huh?

17:52.150 --> 17:54.320
Maya-san and Maria-san, wasn't it?

17:54.320 --> 17:55.260
You know them?

17:55.700 --> 17:58.180
Yes, I met them once.

17:58.180 --> 18:00.470
I sensed boundless energy from them.

18:00.470 --> 18:02.660
Spending time with them must be taxing.

18:02.660 --> 18:04.950
Oh, it is. It really is.

18:04.950 --> 18:07.050
This morning was rough, too.

18:07.050 --> 18:09.980
I have many such tales of hardship myself.

18:10.540 --> 18:13.020
Asahi and Kuon are having 
a lively conversation?

18:12.780 --> 18:13.920
Exactly!

18:13.020 --> 18:15.990
I-I can't help wondering 
what they're talking about.

18:22.700 --> 18:25.760
A disquieting aura has 
begun to drift this way.

18:25.760 --> 18:27.440
And it has become difficult to see.

18:27.440 --> 18:29.820
We should have brought lanterns.

18:30.480 --> 18:32.490
If it's light we need, leave it to me.

18:33.360 --> 18:34.250
Flash!

18:35.790 --> 18:37.460
You're amazing, Asahi!

18:42.100 --> 18:45.640
Th-These are the missing adventurers!

18:45.640 --> 18:47.430
What could've done this?

18:47.730 --> 18:49.090
Huh? What's going on?

18:56.400 --> 18:58.040
A tree monster?

18:58.040 --> 18:59.390
It's a Treant!

18:59.390 --> 19:03.790
It seems this monster is the 
culprit behind the disappearances.

19:09.040 --> 19:10.750
I will save the adventurers.

19:10.750 --> 19:13.420
Asahi and I will beat down this Treant.

19:13.700 --> 19:15.500
A joint effort, huh?

19:16.000 --> 19:17.610
Gloria, let's go!

19:17.900 --> 19:19.380
O-Our...

19:19.380 --> 19:21.670
Our first time working as partners!

19:24.330 --> 19:25.470
Gloria, behind you!

19:31.360 --> 19:32.520
I messed up!

19:32.770 --> 19:33.610
Gloria!

19:33.610 --> 19:34.460
Mistress!

19:36.110 --> 19:39.820
I-I have to hurry and get away or else...

19:41.700 --> 19:44.060
Kuon! Asahi! Are you okay?

19:47.120 --> 19:49.470
What is it? What sort of reaction is that?

19:58.210 --> 20:00.970
Noble Rose Blade!

20:19.880 --> 20:21.840
Well, see you later.

20:23.620 --> 20:26.000
Today was a horrible day.

20:26.000 --> 20:30.490
Was it? But thanks to you, mistress, 
all the adventurers were saved.

20:30.490 --> 20:32.660
Yes, that's true, but...

20:33.930 --> 20:36.560
It was our first date, and yet...

20:36.560 --> 20:38.420
I was there, too, though.

20:40.440 --> 20:41.480
Mistress.

20:41.480 --> 20:44.470
For Mister Asahi, I think today's events...

20:44.840 --> 20:47.080
will live long in his memory.

20:48.080 --> 20:50.020
D-Do you think so?

20:50.020 --> 20:50.730
Yes.

20:53.300 --> 20:54.940
Especially that snow white "item."

20:56.230 --> 21:00.570
I'd rather he forgot about that!

22:38.020 --> 22:40.320
C'mon, c'mon. Which one? Which one?

22:40.320 --> 22:43.540
Hurry up and choose. 
Which one will you pick, Maya?

22:44.100 --> 22:44.750
This one?

22:45.900 --> 22:46.760
Wait, this one?

22:47.690 --> 22:48.570
This one?

22:49.290 --> 22:50.220
This one?

22:50.970 --> 22:53.510
Rumble

22:55.830 --> 22:59.770
<b>Cackle
\h\hCackle
\h\h\h\hCackle</b>

22:58.120 --> 22:59.770
You fell for it again!

23:00.010 --> 23:03.020
Hey! You're not cheating, are you, Kilmaria?

23:05.140 --> 23:09.450
I am Kilmaria of Corruption! 
Causing chaos is my true nature!

23:09.450 --> 23:12.510
But more than that, 
you're just really bad at this, Maya.

23:13.730 --> 23:16.400
Then, we'll decide it with 
the next match, Kilmaria!

23:16.400 --> 23:18.790
I'm home! Sorry I'm late.

23:18.790 --> 23:20.790
Grin

23:19.270 --> 23:20.790
Welcome home, Asahi!

23:20.790 --> 23:23.290
<b>Gaaaah</b>

23:22.490 --> 23:24.040
Asahi...

23:23.290 --> 23:28.300
<b>Maya Wins the 
Pro-Wrestling 
Match</b>

23:23.290 --> 23:28.300
<b>Creak
Creak</b>

23:25.370 --> 23:27.860
Please do something about Maya...

23:29.130 --> 23:32.160
What are you two doing?!

